Verse 1:
[G]O come, all ye [D]faithful, [G]joy[D]ful [G]and [C]tri[G]um[D]phant,
[Em]O come [D]ye, [Am]O[D]co[G]me [D]ye [Em7]to[D]Be[A7]th-le[D]hem!
[Bm]Come [Am]and [G]be[Am7]hold[D7][G]Him, [D]born [G]the [Em]King [Am]of [D]angels!
